This project presents an interactive Power BI dashboard built for a demo cookie company to analyze and visualize business performance across multiple dimensions, including locations, stores, and customers.
The goal of this dashboard is to provide actionable insights into sales trends, customer behavior, and store performance using advanced data modeling and DAX calculations.


FEATURES

Location Analysis – Compare sales performance across different regions

Store Performance – Track KPIs for individual stores/ locations

Customer Insights – Understand purchasing behavior and segmentation

Sales Trends – Monitor revenue over time with dynamic visuals

DAX Measures – Custom calculations for KPIs and business metrics

Interactive Filters – Drill down by date, location, and customer segments



TOOLS & TECHNOLOGIES

Power BI 

DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)

Data Modeling (relationships, star schema design)

Data Cleaning & Transformation (Power Query)
